          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भुखमरी (bhukhmarī) joins भूख, hunger, from Sanskrit bubhukṣā (CDIAL 9286), with मरना, to die: dying of hunger. The vowel of भूख shortens inside the word."
            }
          ]
